  {
   "id": "U1",
   "text": "K2 pays on goods made \"using imported aluminum on which the tariff was paid\".",
   "readings": [
    "U1-a: direct identification: the claimant must show that the metal on which the tariff was paid, or metal traced to it by lot, went into the exported goods",
    "U1-b: substitution: aluminum of the same grade used in the exported goods within three years of an import qualifies against that import's entry, whatever its origin, so domestic metal can stand in for imported metal"
